; S004 FVG -- FundingPips 2-Step Standard $10K, EVALUATION phases (MT5, live).
; The second leg of the prop portfolio: S021 runs on the same account with its
; own magic, so the firm's -5% day is spent by BOTH strategies together.
;
; InpRiskPct=0.5, not the researched 1.0. The grid (backtest/run_s004_risk_grid.py)
; says 1.0 earns more -- median +23,859 against +14,920 over 3 years -- but busts
; 6.98 challenges per 3 years against 3.18. That is the strategy's own risk, and
; it is not why this file says 0.5: the live layer has never filled a real order.
; The shadow pass proved the DECISIONS (2182 match, 0 field divergences), not the
; executions, so slippage and missed limit fills are still unmeasured. 0.5 is the
; price of watching. Raise it to 1.0 -- an input, no rebuild -- once enough real
; fills have been compared with mt5/tools/s004_parity.py.
;
; Worst planned day on the account: S004 2 x 0.50% + S021 1.00% = 2.00%, against
; the firm's 5%. At InpRiskPct=1.0 that becomes 3.00%.
;
; The account guard stays OFF by design, not by oversight: an account near the
; daily limit that refuses to trade is a frozen account, and the arithmetic above
; is the control instead. See the note in S004_FVG.mq5 and
; backtest/run_s004_guard_modes.py.
;
; InpServerTzRule is the BROKER's rule (EET with US DST on prop servers), not
; S004's own clock -- the runtime converts. InpVerifyServerOffset=true makes the
; EA check it against the terminal at init and halt on a mismatch, because the
; failure is otherwise silent: every bar still arrives, just labelled with the
; wrong hour, and the Asia window moves. The `init` event logs
; server_offset_expected_s and server_offset_observed_s -- they must agree.
;
; Attach to ONE chart, any symbol, any timeframe. The EA subscribes to all seven
; pairs itself and refuses a second instance with the same magic.
;
; Enum codes: ServerTzRule/DayResetRule 0=UTC 1=FIXED 2=EET_US_DST 3=EET_EU_DST 4=CET_EU_DST
InpRiskPct=0.5
InpMaxTradesPerDay=2
InpInitialBalance=10000.0
InpDailyGuardPct=0.0
InpMaxGuardPct=0.0
InpDayResetRule=1
InpDayResetFixedHours=3
InpServerTzRule=2
InpServerFixedHours=0
InpVerifyServerOffset=true
InpMagic=4004
InpWarmupBars=1000
InpTradeEnabled=true
InpWriteTradesCsv=true
InpLogToCommon=true
InpTimerSeconds=5
